## Finish
Stop owned background tools with `{{terminal_stop_command}}`, then run `fulcrum finish --bead {{bead}} --thread-id {{thread}} --ownership-operation {{ownership_operation}} --outcome ready_for_review --input - --json`. Supply JSON shaped exactly as `{"summary":"implemented outcome","source_oid":"40 lowercase hex characters","checks":[{"name":"check name","status":"passed","evidence":"observable result"}],"evidence":["path or durable reference"]}`. Once accepted, stop implementation. If blocked, use outcome `blocked` with `summary`, `blocker`, `attempts`, and `required_action`.
